My friend suggested this to me:

Have all classes start out approximately as before, but before actually
entering the dungeon, give them money and allow them to buy from a list
of selected items such as mediocre armor, weapons, and perhaps food.

Of course, they'd have to give up an item or some such to buy something--
perhaps a wizard would trade a scroll or wand for money to buy other
things.  And of course your .nethackrc would contain a line buying the
default if you get sick of that. :)

Just a thought to make the beginning a little easier for some characters,
while not unbalancing the game totally.
